cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource list or the accompanying data, please cite it as below."
title: "Awesome Crystal Prototype: a curated list of crystal structural prototype libraries, algorithms, databases, and CSP resources"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/usccolumbia/awesome-crystal-prototype"
abstract: "A curated list of resources on crystal structural prototypes (libraries, comparison algorithms, source databases, discovery and crystal structure prediction methods), with machine-readable library tables, a bibliography, and family-level results of a GraphID analysis of ICSD, Materials Project, OQMD, and LeMat-Bulk samples. Accompanies the survey 'A Comprehensive Survey of Crystal Structural Prototypes: Construction, Classification, and Applications'."
keywords: [crystal structure prototypes, crystal structure prediction, materials informatics, awesome list]
